    "created_at": "2024-06-10T06:24:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-10T06:24:08Z",
    "body": "I wonder if this should be a separate concept as it represents an intermediate response. We haven't really figured out how we want to expose these to `fetch()` consumers as of yet which makes me worry about standardizing them before we decide how to do that.",
