    "created_at": "2024-06-10T07:19:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-10T07:19:03Z",
    "body": "Supporting only 101 should be fine but I’d rather we don’t violate the spec like Bun and Deno..\r\n\r\n@annevk I mostly agree but given the efforts involved I doubt an entirely new interface would\r\nbe coherent especially since Response is already used in service workers. ",
